    "text": "You can use addition and subtraction to solve this problem. First add the amount of raisins Katrina ate each day. Subtract that number from the total number of raisins Katrina had on Sunday.",
    "example": "Example: Samuel had 50 trading cards. On Monday he gave 5 of his trading cards to Rafael. On Tuesday he gave 6 to Julio. On Wednesday, he gave 9 to Juan. How many trading cards does Samuel have left?",
    "result": "Solution: Total = 50 trading cards Cards given away = 5 + 6 + 9 = 20 Cards left = Total – (Cards given away) = 50 – 20 = 30",
